# Not copied into the image (predict.py/train scripts read models/ and
# data/processed/ via the docker-compose volume mounts instead), but still
# worth excluding from the build CONTEXT sent to the Docker daemon -
# data/raw alone is 302 parquet files, .venv and notebooks are large and
# irrelevant to the image either way.
.venv
.venv_F1
__pycache__
*.pyc
.pytest_cache
notebooks/
data/raw/
data/processed/
models/
tests/
.git
.gitignore
.vscode
.claude
*.egg-info
build/
docs/

# Aug 30 2026 React rebuild: never send these to the Docker daemon as
# part of the build context - frontend-build's own `npm install` inside
# the image is what actually matters, and node_modules/dist here are
# either absent (fresh checkout) or stale artifacts from Damiano running
# `npm run build`/`npm run dev` locally to preview a change before a
# rebuild.
frontend/node_modules
frontend/dist
